    <string name="too_many_wrong_auth_codes_title">Πάρα πολλοί λανθασμένοι κωδικοί πιστοποίησης</string>
    <!-- The placeholder is how long Clementine said to wait before it checks another auth
         code from this phone: "10 seconds", "1 minute", "3 minutes", "2 hours", or "a while" if it
         didn't say. The iOS app shows the same sentence with the duration in iOS's own words,
         which can't take another grammatical form, so write the sentence so the duration reads
         right as it is. -->
    <string name="too_many_wrong_auth_codes">Το Clementine δεν θα ελέγξει άλλον κωδικό πιστοποίησης από αυτό το τηλέφωνο για %s. Έπειτα, εισαγάγετε τον κωδικό που εμφανίζεται στις ρυθμίσεις τηλεχειριστηρίου δικτύου του.</string>
    <!-- How long Clementine said to wait: the placeholder in too_many_wrong_auth_codes and
         download_noti_too_many_wrong_auth_codes. Seconds under a minute; otherwise rounded up to
         minutes, or to hours over an hour. Translate them as a plain duration: those sentences
         are written so it reads right as it is, as the iOS app shows it in iOS's own words. -->
    <plurals name="wait_seconds">
        <item quantity="one">%d δευτερόλεπτο</item>
        <item quantity="other">%d δευτερόλεπτα</item>
    </plurals>
